            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Rise in Soviet Politics</strong><br />\nBoris Yeltsin began his political career as a construction worker and joined the Communist Party, quickly climbing its ranks. By 1976, he became the head of the party in Sverdlovsk and was appointed to the Central Committee in Moscow in 1981.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Leader of the Moscow Communist Party</strong><br />\nIn 1985, Yeltsin was promoted to the position of Secretary of the Communist Party in Moscow, where he was responsible for the capital city's economy and became known for his attempts to reform the bureaucratic system.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fall From Soviet Favor</strong><br />\nYeltsin's outspoken criticism of the slow pace of Mikhail Gorbachev’s reforms led to his dismissal from the Moscow Communist Party leadership in 1987. However, this did not end his political career; instead, he became increasingly popular as a figure of change.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Shift Towards Reform</strong><br />\nAfter his fallout with the party leadership, Yeltsin became an advocate for democratic reform. He was elected to the newly formed Soviet parliament in 1989, where he continued to challenge the conservative Communist government.</p>\n\n<p><strong>First President of the Russian Federation</strong><br />\nYeltsin's rising popularity led to his election as the first president of the Russian Federation in 1991. He was instrumental in the dissolution of the Soviet Union and the establishment of a capitalist economy in post-Soviet Russia.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Reforms and Crisis</strong><br />\nYeltsin's presidency was marked by major economic reforms known as \"shock therapy,\" which transitioned Russia from a state-controlled to a market-based economy. The rapid changes resulted in economic hardship and political turmoil.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
